# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

# WWHN-217: raw log cua gate tai exact SHA la BANG CHUNG dong task (FE217-P1-03 doi
# "raw logs hoac CI run gan 40-char SHA"). Quy tac `*.log` o tren nuot chung im lang, nen
# ai clone lai repo se thay manifest tro toi file khong ton tai. Chi mo lai dung pham vi
# docs/evidence — log rac cua runtime van bi loai nhu cu.
# WWHN-296 (FE296-P1-08): rieng dong `!...*.log` la CHUA DU — quy tac thu muc `logs` o tren
# loai ca thu muc cha, ma git khong the re-include file khi thu muc cha da bi exclude,
# nen log evidence van bi nuot im lang va khong bao gio duoc commit. Phai mo lai
# chinh thu muc logs/ trong docs/evidence truoc, roi dong *.log ben duoi moi co tac dung.
!docs/evidence/**/logs/
!docs/evidence/**/*.log

node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
*.local

# TypeScript incremental build cache (never commit: a stale entry pointing at
# a deleted file makes `tsc -b` fail on every clean checkout)
*.tsbuildinfo

# Env files (giữ lại .env.example để làm mẫu)
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Secrets / captured API responses (never commit tokens/credentials)
login_resp*.txt
*token*.txt
*.jwt
cookies.txt
session.xml
*.session
*response*.json

# Editor directories and files
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea
.DS_Store
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?

# Local tooling artifacts / dumps (not part of source)
coverage/
test-results/
playwright-report/
docs/evidence/wms-contract-signoff/generated/
.mcp.json
.playwright-mcp/
swagger-api.json
swagger-live.html
test-results.txt
tsc-out.txt
vietnam-addresses.json
vietnam-addresses-formatted.txt
test-manager-display.js
package-lock.json
